@EvanCarroll - so this looks to be a brand new license, or really more of a sort of modification to CC-BY-SA-NC that you just created? Which means it has no use as of yet - is that right?

The comments section of the submission form is intended to explain how your license meets the SPDX License List inclusion principles, which you can find at: https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md

Could you please add a comment with that info?
